Thank you for contacting us and for writing in English. You don't need to ask sorry, you are doing your best and this is what matters...!!!

Did you use ground control points (GCPs)? Besides being the same flight plan if your drone doesn't have a GPS-RTK the images maybe are not overlaying correctly.

Does your image resolution in "meters" or "us-feet"?  Are you collecting the average height per plot or min/max values? Does this value of 0.7 from one plot with no plants (dead material and more soil expusure)? Do you have manual phenotyping values from the field collected with a scale/ruler to compare if the results to see if they make sense?

Maybe if you share with us the real mosaic and your code we can look at it to see what is going on.

Hope some of these questions help you.

All the best,
Filipe

